ega Man with loads of information, high-res art, concept pieces, sketches and more in the Museum.<br></li><li><strong>Developed with an all-new engine </strong>– Using the newly developed Eclipse Engine, Capcom and Digital Eclipse are able to archive these six pieces of video game history with faithful reproductions of the originals for a new generation of gamers.<br></li><li><strong>Leaderboards and video replays</strong> – Fans will be able to watch video replays of the top players on the leaderboards, showcasing a whole new generation of <i>Mega Man</i> talent!</li></ul>",
